@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@functionKey = LOCAL-HOST-DOES-NOT-REQUIRE-A-KEY
@catalogId = REPLACE-WITH-CATALOG-ID
@coverFileName = REPLACE-WITH-COVER-FILE-NAME

### Service metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/openapi

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Upload cover — replace the body with binary content in your HTTP client
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/covers?fileName=arrival.png
Content-Type: image/png
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

< ./arrival.png

### Create catalog item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog
Content-Type: application/json
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "synopsis": "A linguist works with visitors from another world.",
  "type": "movie",
  "genres": ["Science Fiction", "Drama"],
  "releaseYear": 2016,
  "ageRating": "12",
  "coverFileName": "{{coverFileName}}"
}

### List catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog?page=1&pageSize=20

### Search by several filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/search?title=Arrival&genre=Science%20Fiction&type=movie&releaseYear=2016

### Get catalog item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/items/{{catalogId}}

### Download cover
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/covers/{{coverFileName}}
